sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Stakeholder as Product Owner / User
    participant MeetingNotes as /meeting-notes Skill
    participant RawToPRD as Skill: raw-to-prd
    participant Workspace as Workspace (PRD.md)
    participant PRDRefine as Skill: prd-refine
    participant DocSuite as Skill: product-doc-suite
    participant Auditor as Skill: product-audit

    Note over Stakeholder,MeetingNotes: Phase 1: Intake & Raw Meeting Notes
    Stakeholder->>MeetingNotes: Submit audio transcript / raw minutes
    MeetingNotes-->>Stakeholder: Return structured meeting minutes

    Note over Stakeholder,RawToPRD: Phase 2: Baseline PRD Synthesis
    Stakeholder->>RawToPRD: /raw-to-prd (Input Meeting Minutes)
    activate RawToPRD
    RawToPRD->>RawToPRD: Extract 7 Core Facets
    RawToPRD->>RawToPRD: Identify unstated facts & inject [UNKNOWN] placeholders
    RawToPRD->>RawToPRD: Generate system topology & sequence diagrams
    RawToPRD->>Workspace: Write initial PRD.md (Living Draft)
    RawToPRD-->>Stakeholder: Present PRD summary + Count of Open Placeholders
    deactivate RawToPRD

    Note over Stakeholder,PRDRefine: Phase 3: Socratic Refinement Loop
    Stakeholder->>PRDRefine: /prd-refine (PRD.md)
    activate PRDRefine
    PRDRefine->>Workspace: Read active [UNKNOWN] & [DECISION NEEDED] blocks
    loop For each unresolved placeholder
        PRDRefine->>Stakeholder: Ask targeted Socratic question with context & options
        Stakeholder-->>PRDRefine: Provide decision / technical clarification
        PRDRefine->>Workspace: Update PRD.md in-place + record Decision Log
    end
    PRDRefine-->>Stakeholder: All placeholders resolved (PRD Frozen)
    deactivate PRDRefine

    Note over Stakeholder,Auditor: Phase 4: Quality Gate & Viability Audit
    Stakeholder->>Auditor: /product-audit (PRD.md)
    activate Auditor
    Auditor->>Workspace: Verify SCI score, diagrams, I/O schemas & boundaries
    Auditor->>Workspace: Write AUDIT-PRD.md (Quality Verdict: PASS)
    Auditor-->>Stakeholder: Audit Report & Coverage Confirmation
    deactivate Auditor

    Note over Stakeholder,DocSuite: Phase 5: Complete Doc Pack Derivation
    Stakeholder->>DocSuite: /product-doc-suite (PRD.md)
    activate DocSuite
    DocSuite->>Workspace: Generate docs/architecture.md (SAD)
    DocSuite->>Workspace: Generate docs/use-cases.md (Capability Matrix)
    DocSuite->>Workspace: Generate docs/contracts.md (Data Schema & I/O)
    DocSuite->>Workspace: Generate docs/viability.md (ROI & Risk Scorecard)
    DocSuite-->>Stakeholder: Full Documentation Suite Created
    deactivate DocSuite
